{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108200","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1510820001:1":{"text":"So this is... the Primal Shrine.","source_cn":"是么……这就是狩猎神殿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1675B83AD4304FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510820002:1":{"text":"The scent of blood seeps from the stone. You can smell it even here.","source_cn":"石料中散发出血腥味，在这里都能闻到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3224D89F6CC3812C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510820003:1":{"text":"The Hunting Goddess' fondness for violence clearly runs deep.","source_cn":"看来那位狩猎神对血的热爱持续了很久。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x892DA887DA1A2F5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510820004:1":{"text":"Shrines are sacred spaces; we can't just barge in. Especially not here. The Hunting Goddess is far more alert than Sarethiel.","source_cn":"神殿是神的领域，不能贸然闯入。何况是司掌狩猎领域的神明...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x369A9414B9ECEB49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510820005:1":{"text":"Come closer. I'll <style=\"highlight\">use magic to mask our presence</style>.","source_cn":"来吧，靠近我，我<style=highlight>用魔...","status":"matched","ha